        {
          "tile_id": "quarterly-trend",
          "type": "chart",
          "title": "Requested vs approved $M and grants won, by submission quarter",
          "datasources": [
            "ds-quarterly"
          ],
          "spec": {
            "layer": [
              {
                "transform": [
                  {
                    "fold": [
                      "REQUESTED_M",
                      "APPROVED_M"
                    ],
                    "as": [
                      "SERIES",
                      "USD_M"
                    ]
                  }
                ],
                "mark": {
                  "type": "bar",
                  "opacity": 0.85
                },
                "encoding": {
                  "x": {
                    "field": "QTR",
                    "type": "temporal",
                    "title": "Submission quarter",
                    "timeUnit": "yearquarter"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "field": "USD_M",
                    "type": "quantitative",
                    "stack": null,
                    "title": "USD (M)"
                  },
                  "color": {
                    "field": "SERIES",
                    "type": "nominal",
                    "title": "Amount",
                    "scale": {
                      "domain": [
                        "REQUESTED_M",
                        "APPROVED_M"
                      ],
                      "range": [
                        "#11567F",
                        "#29B5E8"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "tooltip": [
                    {
                      "field": "QTR",
                      "type": "temporal",
                      "timeUnit": "yearquarter",
                      "title": "Quarter"
                    },
                    {
                      "field": "SERIES",
                      "type": "nominal"
                    },
                    {
                      "field": "USD_M",
                      "type": "quantitative",
                      "title": "$M"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "mark": {
                  "type": "line",
                  "color": "#FF9F36",
                  "strokeWidth": 3,
                  "point": true
                },
                "encoding": {
                  "x": {
                    "field": "QTR",
                    "type": "temporal",
                    "timeUnit": "yearquarter"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "field": "WON",
                    "type": "quantitative",
                    "title": "Grants won"
                  },
                  "tooltip": [
                    {
                      "field": "WON",
                      "type": "quantitative",
                      "title": "Grants won"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ],
            "resolve": {
              "scale": {
                "y": "independent"
              }
            }
          },
          "scope": "quarter_hover",
          "interactions": [
            {
              "trigger": "hover",
              "operator": "show_crosshair",
              "targets": [
                {
                  "scope": "quarter_hover"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tile_id": "exec-summary",
          "type": "text",
          "title": "Executive summary (as at 18 Nov 2026, unfiltered)",
          "text": "- **$152.2M approved** of $292.5M requested across 653 applications; **73.7% win rate** on decided grants.\n- **Decision backlog:** 163 grants ($66.5M) still Submitted or Under Review; 2026-Q2 cycle time hit 114 days.\n- **Donor pipeline** $88.7M open, $46.3M weighted, $30.6M committed — but $12.5M weighted sits on declined grants.\n- **Execution capacity** is the top AI-flagged risk (41% of grants) and carries the lowest reviewer scores."
        },
        {
          "tile_id": "decision-days",
          "type": "chart",
          "title": "Average days to decision, by submission quarter",
          "datasources": [
            "ds-quarterly"
          ],
          "spec": {
            "mark": {
              "type": "area",
              "line": true,
              "opacity": 0.35,
              "color": "#7D44CF"
            },
            "encoding": {
              "x": {
                "field": "QTR",
                "type": "temporal",
                "timeUnit": "yearquarter",
                "title": "Submission quarter"
              },
              "y": {
                "field": "AVG_DAYS",
                "type": "quantitative",
                "title": "Days"
              },
              "tooltip": [
                {
                  "field": "QTR",
                  "type": "temporal",
                  "timeUnit": "yearquarter",
                  "title": "Quarter"
                },
                {
                  "field": "AVG_DAYS",
                  "type": "quantitative",
                  "title": "Days"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "scope": "quarter_hover",
          "interactions": [
            {
              "trigger": "hover",
              "operator": "show_crosshair",
              "targets": [
                {
                  "scope": "quarter_hover"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tile_id": "status-donut",
          "type": "chart",
          "title": "Status mix (grants)",
          "datasources": [
            "ds-status-mix"
          ],
          "spec": {
            "mark": "arc",
            "encoding": {
              "theta": {
                "field": "GRANTS",
                "type": "quantitative"
              },
              "color": {
                "field": "STATUS",
                "type": "nominal",
                "title": "Status",
                "scale": {
                  "domain": [
                    "Paid",
                    "Approved",
                    "Under Review",
                    "Submitted",
                    "Draft",
                    "Declined"
                  ],
                  "range": [
                    "#11567F",
                    "#29B5E8",
                    "#FF9F36",
                    "#FFD166",
                    "#8A99AD",
                    "#D45B90"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "tooltip": [
                {
                  "field": "STATUS",
                  "type": "nominal"
                },
                {
                  "field": "GRANTS",
                  "type": "quantitative"
                },
                {
                  "field": "REQUESTED_M",
                  "type": "quantitative",
                  "title": "Requested $M"
                }
              ]
            },
            "usermeta": {
              "snowflake": {
                "chartConfig": {
                  "innerRadius": 55,
                  "centerTotal": {
                    "enabled": true
                  },
                  "dataLabels": {
                    "enabled": true
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tab_id": "portfolio",
      "title": "Portfolio Breakdown",
      "tiles": [
        {
          "tile_id": "pf-intro",
          "type": "text",
          "title": "About this view",
          "text": "**Where the money goes.** Click a program bar to drill into its initiatives (breadcrumb to return), expand regions to see countries, and switch the **Breakdown metric** control to re-rank by approved, requested, weighted or committed dollars."
        },
        {
          "tile_id": "program-drill",
          "type": "chart",
          "title": "Program area → initiative (click to drill; metric control sets the measure, $M)",
          "datasources": [
            "ds-program-drill"
          ],
          "spec": {
            "mark": {
              "type": "bar",
              "color": "#29B5E8",
              "cornerRadiusEnd": 3
            },
            "encoding": {
              "y": {
                "field": "LEVEL_LABEL",
                "type": "nominal",
                "sort": "-x",
                "title": null
              },
              "x": {
                "field": "VALUE_M",
                "type": "quantitative",
                "title": "$M (selected metric)"
              },
              "tooltip": [
                {
                  "field": "LEVEL_LABEL",
                  "type": "nominal",
                  "title": "Member"
                },
                {
                  "field": "VALUE_M",
                  "type": "quantitative",
                  "title": "$M"
                },
                {
                  "field": "GRANTS",
                  "type": "quantitative"
                }
              ]
            },
            "usermeta": {
              "snowflake": {
                "chartConfig": {
                  "dataLabels": {
                    "enabled": true
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "scope": "program_drill",
          "interactions": [
            {
              "trigger": "select",
              "fields": [
                "LEVEL_KEY"
              ],
              "operator": "drill_down",
              "targets": [
                {
                  "scope": "program_drill",
                  "fields": [
                    "LEVEL_KEY"
                  ],
                  "hierarchy": "program"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "trigger": "select_hierarchy_level",
              "operator": "drill_up",
              "targets": [
                {
                  "scope": "program_drill",
                  "hierarchy": "program"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "trigger": "select_hierarchy_level",
              "operator": "set_hierarchy_level",
              "targets": [
                {
                  "scope": "program_drill",
                  "hierarchy": "program"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tile_id": "geo-tree",
          "type": "table",
          "title": "Region → country (expand rows)",
          "datasources": [
            "ds-geo-tree"
          ],
          "spec": {
